    "updated_at": "2020-02-23T18:26:36Z",
    "body": "Starship overrides any prompt configuration defined by Oh My Zsh.\r\nInstalling it by following the [zsh installation instructions](https://github.com/starship/starship#zsh) should make it work perfectly alongside Oh My Zsh. No need to do anything special in `~/.oh-my-zsh`.",
